 "description": "PMOS-pass LDO (gpdk045, VIN = VDD_core 1.8 V, VREF 0.6 V, VOUT 1.2 V): two-stage Miller-compensated error amplifier (NMOS pair M2/M4, PMOS mirror load, PMOS CS second stage M7), PMOS buffer M9 with R10/R7, five 350 um pass devices, R9/C0 gate network, 50/50 ohm feedback divider with C1 feed-forward. Fixture and measurement definitions = the golden replay pack (Maestro Load_reg and PM_min tests): behavioural 25 mA load sink, 100 pF output capacitor, stb at the M4 gate, AC 1 V on VIN, 1 s transient, DC load sweep 0-50 mA. Conditions: the replay's 15 (tt/ss/ff/sf/fs x -40/27/125 C, VIN 1.8 V; nominal tt 27 C). Targets: the replay pack's targets.json limits exactly (owner-approved paper/source references with a 15 % allowance), at every condition. Line regulation is excluded (batch rule). No objective.",
